	(text "INJ into the AN0 lane (D7, 2026-11-27): D11 1N4148W + R40 1k from INJ to the AN0 tap"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 173.99 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4d78f852-2920-5359-aab8-ecbfb7575c6d")
	)
	(text "INJ high (3.3 V) lifts AN0 by about 0.55 V (0.43-0.58 V over tolerances, estimate) and AN1-AN3 by 3/4,\n1/2, 1/4 of that; INJ low leaves the ladder alone (D11 reverse-biased, < 10 uV of leakage error).\nThe latency rig can then time the lane path, not only IRQ_N. Drive INJ only while the slot is powered."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 173.99 19.05 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(italic yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e59118e9-5f27-5371-8653-aea8d4dbb56c")
	)
